  "description": "<p style=\"text-align: left; font-size: 14px; font-weight: normal;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">Leprd is modernizing the home cleaning experience. Here are a few reasons why customers choose us:</span></p>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><strong>Leprd Guarantee</strong> - All of our services are 5 star service guaranteed. If for whatever reason you&rsquo;re not satisfied, we&rsquo;ll make it right</span></li>\r\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><strong>Clean Products</strong> - All of our products are clean and safe for kids: no parabens, no phtalates, non-GMO, and cruelty free. You&rsquo;re home also won&rsquo;t smell chemically after we&rsquo;re done.</span></li>\r\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><strong>Professional Cleaners</strong> - Our cleaners are genuinely good people. They go through a rigorous hiring process and are background checked. They come in uniforms and wear black gloves and black shoe booties to respect your space.</span></li>\r\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><strong>Luxury hotel level service</strong> - One of our advisors is a VP at the 4 Seasons Resorts &amp; Hotels and has helped us develop our cleaning process. Look out for the extra touches we provide like a wax seal on the toilet paper, chocolates on your nightstand, and flowers and a note for first time cleanings.</span></li>\r\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><strong>Easy to book</strong> - transparent pricing and online scheduling</span></li>\r\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><strong>Fully insured up to $1M</strong></span></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p style=\"text-align: left; font-size: 14px; font-weight: normal;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">&nbsp;Because we offer an e-commerce style shopping experience that allows us to offer affiliate commissions to influencers and our partners which previously hasn't been done in the home cleaning space. We offer 10% commission on all sales which is substantial given that most cleanings are at least a few hundred dollars.&nbsp;</span></p>\r\n<p style=\"text-align: left; font-size: 14px; font-weight: normal;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">We're excited to work with you! Currently we only offer services in Utah.</span></p>",
